{"id":"b4756bc85be4e874","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-closed-fragment.md","title":"基项归约片段","display":"df-closed-fragment — 基项归约片段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-closed-fragment","aliases":["56-df-closed-fragment"],"display":"df-closed-fragment — 基项归约片段","depends_on":["[[56-df-ground-terms]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1, printed p75","source_ocr_block":"96","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-closed-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-closed-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-fragment — 基项归约片段"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1, printed p75"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\\subseteq T^2\">\\(\\to_R\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 为一步归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{R,0}\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cap(G\\times G),\\qquad(\\Sigma,R)_0\\coloneqq(G,\\to_{R,0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{R,0}\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cap(G\\times G),\\qquad(\\Sigma,R)_0\\coloneqq(G,\\to_{R,0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.4.1（印刷 p75，OCR 页块96）。此构造使用限制关系，避免把整个载体的关系未经限制直接称为子系统。基项非空是该节采用的约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_{R,0}\\coloneqq\\to_R\\cap(G\\times G),\\qquad(\\Sigma,R)_0\\coloneqq(G,\\to_{R,0}).","display":true}],"bytes":959,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-closed-fragment.md]]"},{"id":"9871b3f02563bee2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["eccf433851609ffb","a3b60e1e9cdeef27","89129816153530db"]}